Description:
    Generates all files for a Statesman state machine: the transition model,
    transition policy, state machine service, GraphQL enum type, transition type,
    edge type, connection type, and resolver.

Arguments:
    NAME    The PascalCase owner model name (e.g. CertificationLevel)

Options:
    --states   Array of state names for the state machine (e.g. active archived)

Example:
    bin/rails generate vog:statesman CertificationLevel --states active archived

    This will create:
        app/graphql/types/certification_level_state_type.rb
        app/models/certification_level_transition.rb
        app/policies/certification_level_transition_policy.rb
        app/services/certification_levels/state_machine.rb
        app/graphql/types/certification_level_transition_type.rb
        app/graphql/types/certification_level_transition_edge_type.rb
        app/graphql/types/certification_level_transition_connection_type.rb
        app/services/resolvers/certification_level_transition_resolver.rb
